@startuml overall-architecture
!theme blueprint
title LaTeXML ArXiv Processing System - Overall Architecture

actor "Frontend Client" as client
rectangle "API Layer" {
  component "Oak API Server\nmain.ts" as api
  component "ProgressWorker\nEvent System" as progress
  component "Server-Sent Events\nStream" as sse
}

rectangle "Processing Pipeline" {
  component "Download ArXiv\nSource" as download
  component "Extract\nTarball" as extract
  component "Compile LaTeX\nto HTML" as compile
  component "Post-process\nHTML" as postprocess
  component "Cleanup\nGeneration" as cleanup
  component "Generate\nEmbeddings" as embeddings
  component "Upload to\nGoogle Drive" as upload
}

database "Local Storage" {
  storage "./tmp/\nStorage" as tmp
  storage "ML Models\nLocal Storage" as models
}

cloud "External Services" {
  component "ArXiv\ne-print API" as arxiv
  component "LaTeXML\nCompiler" as latexml
  component "Google Drive\nCloud Storage" as gdrive
}

' Main flow connections
client --> api : HTTP Request
api --> sse : Create Stream
sse --> progress : Register Client
client <-- sse : Real-time Updates

api --> download
download --> extract
extract --> compile
compile --> postprocess
postprocess --> cleanup
cleanup --> embeddings
embeddings --> upload

' External connections
download --> arxiv : Fetch Source
compile --> latexml : Convert LaTeX
upload --> gdrive : Store Files

' Storage connections
download ..> tmp : Store Tarball
extract ..> tmp : Extract Files
compile ..> tmp : Generate HTML
postprocess ..> tmp : Process HTML
cleanup ..> tmp : Clean Files
embeddings ..> tmp : Save Embeddings
embeddings ..> models : Load Models

' Progress reporting (dotted lines)
download ..> progress : Progress Updates
extract ..> progress : Progress Updates
compile ..> progress : Progress Updates
postprocess ..> progress : Progress Updates
cleanup ..> progress : Progress Updates
embeddings ..> progress : Progress Updates
upload ..> progress : Progress Updates

note right of progress
  Event-driven progress tracking
  • Real-time SSE updates
  • Multi-client support
  • Session management
  • Error propagation
end note

note bottom of "Processing Pipeline"
  Six-step processing workflow:
  1. Download source from ArXiv
  2. Extract LaTeX files
  3. Compile to HTML with LaTeXML
  4. Post-process and enhance HTML
  5. Generate semantic embeddings
  6. Upload to Google Drive
end note

@enduml